NOTE ON INDEXED CONTENT

This licence covers SkillAppMD's own source code only.

It does NOT cover the SKILL.md files this project indexes. Each of those remains
under the licence of the repository that published it, and 60.1% of them resolve
to `unknown` — meaning no licence could be determined, which is not permission.
SkillAppMD serves no third-party skill content under any licence (REQ-062); it
records where each file came from and points at the origin.
